# Build artifacts and dependencies excluded from Docker/nixpacks build context.
# Without this the context is multi-GB (Elixir _build, deps, node_modules, .next).
#
# NOTE: do NOT blanket-exclude **/dist — js/packages/core/dist is the published
# entry point that `@barkpark/core` consumers (including web/) resolve against.
# Excluding it breaks `cd web && pnpm build` because Next can't find the module.
**/node_modules
**/_build
**/deps
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
web/dist
docs-site/build
docs-site/.docusaurus

# Elixir / Phoenix
**/*.beam
**/erl_crash.dump
api/priv/static/cache_manifest.json

# Logs and OS junk
**/*.log
.DS_Store

# Git & editor
.git
.idea
.vscode
.turbo
.paperflow

# Local env files (re-add explicitly in builders if needed)
.env
.env.local
**/.env
**/.env.local

# Heavy / out-of-scope subtrees for the web image
api
cloud
docs-site
obsidian_example
IndxData
